<title>USA: Wheeling-Pittsburgh to raise tin mill prices.</title>
<headline>Wheeling-Pittsburgh to raise tin mill prices.</headline>
<dateline>WHEELING, W.Va. 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>WHX Corp's Wheeling-Pittsburgh Steel Corp subsidiary said Friday it will raise prices on tin mill products effective with shipments on January 5, 1997.</p>
<p>The company said base prices, thickness and coating extras will be increased by 2.75 percent on tin plate, tin coated sheet and black plate products.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
